<chapter xml:id="ch-how-learning-travels" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>How Learning Travels</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      Explore–Describe–Present follows repeated workshops refining both practical language and the support offered. Exploring data, addressing a research question and communicating to an audience require different judgements. Other named pathways can show how learning develops through relationships and careers, without turning continuity into an unsupported claim of impact.
    </p>
  </introduction>

